  "title": "Jay's Spicy Slow Cooker Turkey Chili",
  "description": "Jay's spicy slow-cooker turkey chili perfectly combines seasonings, chile peppers, beans, and turkey. You can prep it ahead, then slow cook it later.",
  "authors": [
